rarity and drop-source confidence are separate; unverified source pairings are labelled. Level bands are planning guidance, not entrance requirements. Blizzard listed 30+ when opening this dungeon; that is not a verified equip-level rule.",ba=true,ra={ck=S[133],r={},t={{id=9431,n="Papal Fez",mob=S[26],st=S[32],no=S[13]},{id=9397,n=S[623],mob=S[26],st=S[32],no=S[13]},{id=9393,n=S[608],mob=S[26],st=S[32],no=S[13]},{id=9381,n="Earthen Rod",mob=S[26],st=S[32],no=S[13]}},no={S[49],S[34]}}},{n="Zul'Farrak",lr="44–54",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Maraudon",lr="46–55",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Alcaz Prison",lr="48–53",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="The Temple of Atal'Hakkar",lr="50–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Blackrock Depths",lr="52–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Dire Maul",lr="54–60",st=S[151],no="Not yet confirmed for this beta loot guide. We do not have confirmed dungeon-drop data. Wings: East 54–60, North and West 56–60.",ba=false},{n="Lower Blackrock Spire",lr="55–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Blackmaw Hold",lr="55–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Scholomance",lr="58–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Stratholme",lr="58–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Shaper’s Terrace",lr="58–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false},{n="Upper Blackrock Spire",lr="59–60",st=S[151],no=S[37],ba=false}},professions={{n="Tailoring",b="Cloth armor, bags and Warlock soul bags. Forever adds Shadow and Black lines of Shadow-damage gear, plus Shadoweave, Felcloth and Robe of the Void for later levels.",cv="The strongest pieces bind on pickup, so you must craft them yourself. Pairs naturally with Enchanting."},{n="Enchanting",b="Disenchants unwanted magical equipment and improves gear. Crafts Lesser and Greater Magic Wands, and supports camp and craft tools.",cv="Avoid expensive enhancements on pieces you will soon replace."},{n="Alchemy",b="Mana restoration, caster elixirs such as Elixir of Shadow Power and Elixir of Fire Power, and utility potions.",cv="Ordinary healing potions are First Aid crafts in Forever; discolored Alchemy potions have a different effect."},{n="Engineering",b="Explosives, target dummies and utility devices; later repair and reagent support.",cv="Pairs with Mining. Guns and scopes are not Warlock spellcasting upgrades."},{n="Herbalism",b="Herbs and seeds for Alchemy; Incense Candle and gardening tools at camp.",cv="Camp benefits are temporary or shared; do not treat profession knowledge as permanent Intellect."},{n="Mining",b="Ore, stone and metal for Engineering, plus mining camp tools.",cv="Melee attack power from a camp effect is not spell power."},{n="Skinning",b="Leather, hides and scales from eligible beasts; easy early income while you buy Grimoires for your demons.",cv="It does not make leather armor wearable by a Warlock."},{n="Cooking",b="Food, drink and campfires; some meals give stat buffs and extra leveling experience.",cv="Warlocks cannot conjure food or water, so Cooking and bought drinks cover your recovery between pulls."},{n="First Aid",b="Bandages, normal healing potions and condition-removal items.",cv="Damage interrupts bandaging; read combat restrictions on cures."},{n="Fishing",b="Fish for Cooking and selected recipes; fishing camp tools.",cv="No guaranteed income or best-profession claim is implied."}},gearBrackets={{b="Quest rewards",no="Warlock class quests and dungeon quests whose rewards are recorded on the Forever beta server. Quest rewards carry no level requirement of their own, so each tooltip shows the quest level and the level you can pick the quest up from. Sorted by quest level; check faction before planning a route.",keys={"warlock-6","warlock-7","warlock-8","warlock-18","warlock-19","warlock-22","warlock-27","warlock-28","warlock-23","warlock-13","warlock-24","warlock-14","warlock-29","warlock-12","warlock-33","warlock-31","warlock-34","warlock-565","warlock-32","warlock-35","warlock-36","warlock-566"}},{b="1-19",no=S[40],keys={"warlock-265","warlock-275","warlock-281","warlock-294","warlock-301"}},{b="20-29",no=S[40],keys={"warlock-299","warlock-313","warlock-318","warlock-325","warlock-321","warlock-543"}},{b="30-39",no=S[40],keys={"warlock-323","warlock-339","warlock-346","warlock-351","warlock-366","warlock-546"}},{b="40-49",no=S[40],keys={"warlock-373","warlock-548","warlock-370","warlock-551","warlock-385","warlock-552","warlock-389","warlock-407"}},{b="50-60",no=S[40],keys={"warlock-557","warlock-413","warlock-558","warlock-443","warlock-559","warlock-464","warlock-561","warlock-457","warlock-471"}}}})
